            "description": {
              "content": "Streams a point-in-time snapshot of the etcd database as a binary blob. The snapshot can be used to create a backup of the etcd data or to restore a cluster to a previous state. The snapshot is streamed in chunks to support large database sizes. This operation should be performed on a healthy cluster member to ensure consistency.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
